{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Question answered: Which sensor, tag, or station stopped agreeing?\n\nHow to read it: A single hot sensor row points to a sensor or tag problem. A station-wide hot band points to machine or process change.\n\nWhy it matters: This prevents treating bad telemetry as machine drift.\n\nNext action: Inspect the hot sensor or tag first if isolated; inspect process variables if station-wide.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 75
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max by (source, subsystem) (metricchrono_industrial_sensor_disagreement_score{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\",source=~\"$source\",comparison=~\"sensor_vs_sensor|sensor_vs_controller|station_vs_line\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} {{subsystem}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Sensor Agreement Heatmap",
      "type": "heatmap"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Question answered: Which sensor or tag is least reliable right now?\n\nHow to read it: Low score means the source may be stale, missing, noisy, or inconsistent.\n\nWhy it matters: Industrial dashboards often contain stale tags that look like stable process values.\n\nNext action: Inspect tag mapping, controller update, network path, sensor wiring, or calibration.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 80
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 90
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "min by (source) (min_over_time(metricchrono_industrial_sensor_reliability_score{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\",source=~\"$source\"}[2m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} reliability",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Sensor Reliability Score",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Question answered: Did the data stream degrade?\n\nHow to read it: Missing or late tags rising during a process-change event may mean telemetry degraded rather than the machine changed.\n\nWhy it matters: Telemetry reliability is often the difference between a process incident and a data incident.\n\nNext action: Inspect controller connectivity, gateway, tag subscription, network, and historian or exporter path.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 75
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (source) (metricchrono_industrial_source_missing_total{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\",source=~\"$source\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} missing",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (source) (metricchrono_industrial_source_late_total{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\",source=~\"$source\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} late",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max by (source) (metricchrono_industrial_tag_freshness_seconds{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\",source=~\"$source\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} freshness",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Missing / Late Tags",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Question answered: Did cycle behavior shift, or was there one bad cycle?\n\nHow to read it: A distribution shift indicates sustained process or cycle drift. A single tail event suggests a transient interruption.\n\nWhy it matters: Industrial engineers care about recurring cycle loss, not just isolated outliers.\n\nNext action: If the distribution shifts, inspect bottleneck, mechanical condition, process variable drift, and material flow.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 75
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (metricchrono_industrial_cycle_time_seconds_bucket{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\",le=~\".*\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 cycle time",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (metricchrono_industrial_cycle_time_seconds_bucket{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\",le=~\".*\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 cycle time",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Cycle-Time Distribution",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Question answered: Is the machine physically behaving differently?\n\nHow to read it: Rising physical change indicates machine or process load changed even before quality or downtime changes.\n\nWhy it matters: This is the industrial engineer's early warning layer.\n\nNext action: Inspect load, friction, bearings, motor, cooling, pressure or flow path, lubrication, or process material.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 75
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_industrial_vibration_change_score{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{asset}} vibration",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_industrial_motor_current_change_score{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{asset}} current",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_industrial_temperature_change_score{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{asset}} temperature",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_industrial_pressure_change_score{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{asset}} pressure",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "D"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_industrial_flow_change_score{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{asset}} flow",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "E"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Machine Physical Change",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Question answered: Which process variable moved with the change score?\n\nHow to read it: If a process variable moves before the change score, it may be causal or upstream. If it moves after, it may be an effect.\n\nWhy it matters: Industrial engineers need to connect change detection to known process variables.\n\nNext action: Inspect the process variable that moves first.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 75
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_industrial_process_variable_value{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\",source=\"torque\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} value",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_industrial_process_change_score{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\",comparison=\"known_good_baseline\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{asset}} process change",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_industrial_cycle_change_score{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\",comparison=\"current_vs_target\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{asset}} cycle change",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Process Variable vs Change Score",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Question answered: Is this station uniquely abnormal or part of a line-wide shift?\n\nHow to read it: A station much higher than the line suggests local issue. Station and line rising together suggests material, schedule, changeover, or line-wide condition.\n\nWhy it matters: This points investigation to local maintenance or line/system conditions.\n\nNext action: Inspect local station if isolated; inspect material flow, line state, upstream and downstream if broad.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 75
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_industrial_station_change_score{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\",comparison=~\"station_vs_line|peer_asset\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{asset}} station",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_industrial_line_change_score{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\",comparison=\"station_vs_line\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{asset_group}} line",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Station vs Line Comparison",
      "type": "bargauge"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Question answered: Is the process change affecting output quality?\n\nHow to read it: If quality change rises after process change, the drift may be turning into scrap or rework risk.\n\nWhy it matters: This connects telemetry to production impact.\n\nNext action: Prioritize incidents with quality impact over isolated telemetry movement.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 75
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_industrial_process_change_score{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\",comparison=\"known_good_baseline\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{asset}} process",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_industrial_quality_change_score{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\",comparison=\"known_good_baseline\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{asset}} quality change",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_industrial_reject_rate{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{asset}} reject rate",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Quality Impact Correlation",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Question answered: Are we comparing the machine to the correct state?\n\nHow to read it: If machine state is changeover, the dashboard should compare against changeover behavior, not running behavior.\n\nWhy it matters: False positives during changeover destroy trust.\n\nNext action: If baseline is wrong, do not treat the change as an incident; fix baseline and state mapping.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 75
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".* line$|.* cell$|.* machine$|.* line state$|.* machine state$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "color": "green",
                        "text": "running"
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "color": "green",
                        "text": "idle"
                      },
                      "2": {
                        "color": "yellow",
                        "text": "starved"
                      },
                      "3": {
                        "color": "orange",
                        "text": "blocked"
                      },
                      "4": {
                        "color": "blue",
                        "text": "changeover"
                      },
                      "5": {
                        "color": "blue",
                        "text": "maintenance"
                      },
                      "6": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "text": "fault"
                      },
                      "7": {
                        "color": "blue",
                        "text": "recovery"
                      },
                      "8": {
                        "color": "orange",
                        "text": "unknown"
                      }
                    },
                    "type": "value"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".* incident window$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "color": "green",
                        "text": "pre incident"
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "text": "incident"
                      },
                      "2": {
                        "color": "blue",
                        "text": "recovery"
                      },
                      "3": {
                        "color": "orange",
                        "text": "ongoing"
                      }
                    },
                    "type": "value"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_industrial_machine_state_code{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{asset}} machine state",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_industrial_line_state_code{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{asset}} line state",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_industrial_baseline_in_use{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\",comparison=~\"same_machine_state|known_good_baseline\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{asset}} baseline {{comparison}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_industrial_process_change_score{site=\"$site\",environment=\"$environment\",recipe=\"industrial-telemetry\",asset_group=~\"$asset_group\",asset=~\"$asset\",comparison=~\"same_machine_state|known_good_baseline\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{asset}} process {{comparison}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Planned Changeover Guard",
      "type": "state-timeline"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Question answered: What did the machine or controller already report?\n\nHow to read it: Rows summarize bounded categories, not raw messages.\n\nWhy it matters: Existing controller diagnostics should remain primary when they are clear.\n\nNext action: Use diagnostics as primary explanation if aligned with process change.",
      "fieldConfig": {
